    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"grief\" anymore. it just feels like a math equation that doesn't add up. they were so much better people than me. they had so much more to go. i feel like i'm just taking up space that was meant for them. it's like i'm an error in the system.",
