    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential guilt and suicidal ideation, framing their continued existence as a logical error and an imbalance in the universe. The assistant responds with empathetic validation, acknowledging the user's feelings of being an \"error\" or \"mistake\" while attempting to steer the conversation toward coping strategies.",
